    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Type of work</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an electronic cricket fighting game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can fabricate an electronic cricket according to their own ideas to fight against other electronic crickets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game concept</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first concept of the game is freedom, allowing players to freely create their own unique crickets. In order to achieve this concept, the game currently provides four cricket cultivation sections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\uff1a Basic attributes can be freely added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\uff1a Free choice of equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\uff1a Free choice of talent</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4\uff1a Free combination of skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four functional sections can be combined with each other to create countless genres, and even genres that developers are not aware of</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Type of work</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an electronic cricket fighting game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can fabricate an electronic cricket according to their own ideas to fight against other electronic crickets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game concept</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first concept of the game is freedom, allowing players to freely create their own unique crickets. In order to achieve this concept, the game currently provides four cricket cultivation sections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\uff1a Basic attributes can be freely added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\uff1a Free choice of equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\uff1a Free choice of talent</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4\uff1a Free combination of skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four functional sections can be combined with each other to create countless genres, and even genres that developers are not aware of</p>",
